astest train.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":787,\"title\":\"Mr. & Mrs. Smith\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kjD700RtyhveN3ZbOnSvUSne0Qj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wBPxAlZF6ITQ6T5BMmVuVjeduTe.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A husband and wife struggle to keep their marriage alive until they realize they are both secretly working as assassins. Now, their respective assignments require them to kill each other.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1390300,\"title\":\"Over Your Dead Body\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kZCauMzAt9eMAhLMopCqnFw1Q5k.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sb76azrAXr9U13uEQxNP5e3fujY.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A dysfunctional couple head to a remote cabin to \\\"reconnect\\\", but each has secret intentions to kill the other.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":390043,\"title\":\"The Hitman's Bodyguard\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5CGjlz2vyBhW5xHW4eNOZIdgzYq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7KsqfXDECZMryX1Rv4RKsT7SIjQ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The world’s top bodyguard gets a new client, a hitman who must testify at the International Court of Justice. They must put their differences aside and work together to make it to the trial on time.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":749170,\"title\":\"Heads of State\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lVgE5oLzf7ABmzyASEVcjYyHI41.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vJbEUMeI2AxBUZKjP6ZVeVNNTLh.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The UK Prime Minister and US President have a public rivalry that risks their countries' alliance. But when they become targets of a powerful enemy, they're forced to rely on each other as they go on a wild, multinational run. Allied with Noel, a brilliant MI6 agent, they must find a way to thwart a conspiracy that threatens the free world.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":39514,\"title\":\"RED\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8eeK3OB5PeSRQD7BpZcGZKkehG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5tqBeCUaNHptScH3rBixjE5z2NV.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After surviving an assault from a squad of hit men, retired CIA black ops agent Frank Moses reassembles his old team for an all-out war. Frank reunites with old Joe, crazy Marvin and wily Victoria to uncover a massive conspiracy that threatens their lives. Only their expert training will allow them to survive a near-impossible mission -- breaking into CIA headquarters.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":522931,\"title\":\"Hitman's Wife's Bodyguard\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6zwGWDpY8Zu0L6W4SYWERBR8Msw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bjIPzixuWnOzxDG25WaXKuy9lYZ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The world’s most lethal odd couple – bodyguard Michael Bryce and hitman Darius Kincaid – are back on another life-threatening mission. Still unlicensed and under scrutiny, Bryce is forced into action by Darius's even more volatile wife, the infamous international con artist Sonia Kincaid. As Bryce is driven over the edge by his two most dangerous protectees, the trio get in over their heads in a global plot and soon find that they are all that stand between Europe and a vengeful and powerful madman.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":604822,\"title\":\"Vanguard\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mKvw1Ic9enfFlCPBNJGiejRPMUO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fX8e94MEWSuTJExndVYxKsmA4Hw.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Covert security company Vanguard is the last hope of survival for an accountant after he is targeted by the world's deadliest mercenary organization.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":23631,\"title\":\"Machete\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dcPSm1rGEFdiEc7DaKz0t5kb66b.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wbjoD8BN5W9VusuLJYdd7tWUxqh.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After being set-up and betrayed by the man who hired him to assassinate a Texas Senator, an ex-Federale launches a brutal rampage of revenge against his former boss.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10159,\"title\":\"The Rundown\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cwNeP2fz0vqNhmKIcSgLD0xc6g2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i7ClLxhjClTCXGBt3FLC4hbEvU.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Travis, the mouthy son of a criminal, disappears in the Amazon in search of a treasured artifact, his father sends in Beck, who becomes Travis's rival for the affections of Mariana, a mysterious Brazilian woman. With his steely disposition, Beck is a man of few words -- but it takes him all the discipline he can muster to work with Travis to nab a tyrant who's after the same treasure.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11665,\"title\":\"Get Smart\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sZUjbtUS8qxXp4mj90evnqPJqX7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u0yaNgikY92zkI0t3fiEGZP3UWq.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When members of the nefarious crime syndicate KAOS attack the U.S. spy agency Control and the identities of secret agents are compromised, the Chief has to promote hapless but eager analyst Maxwell Smart to field agent. He is partnered with veteran and capable Agent 99, the only spy whose cover remains intact. Can they work together to thwart the evil world-domination plans of KAOS and its crafty operative?\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":604,\"title\":\"The Matrix Reloaded\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8xEVAe84zlL9rkfYT6dZXero4KK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ihOJcrorpDQtHTzIOrobbOhpJsj.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Resistance builds in numbers as humans are freed from the Matrix and brought to the city of Zion. Neo discovers his superpowers, including the ability to see the code inside the Matrix. With machine sentinels digging to Zion in 72 hours, Neo, Morpheus and Trinity must find the Keymaker to ultimately reach the Source.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"B6Z9MM1LhEA\",\"name\":\"UK Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"m8JUmBgHejI\",\"name\":\"Final Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"otxjH3lrunU\",\"name\":\"What if RUNNER was a K-drama?\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}